# Helper Functions

Dokan Kits provides a collection of helper functions for common tasks.

## Main Helper File

- [includes/functions.php](mdc:includes/functions.php): Contains all helper functions

## Container and Services

```php
// Get the container
$container = dokan_kits_get_container();

// Get a service
$service = dokan_kits_service('service-id');
```

## Settings Management

```php
// Get a setting
$setting = dokan_kits_get_setting('setting-name');

// Get a setting value
$value = dokan_kits_get_setting_value('setting-name', 'key', 'default-value');

// Update a setting
dokan_kits_update_setting('setting-name', 'value', 'new-value');

// Delete a setting
dokan_kits_delete_setting('setting-name');
```

## Templates

```php
// Get a template part
dokan_kits_get_template_part('template-slug', 'part-name', [
    'var1' => 'value1',
    'var2' => 'value2',
]);

// Get a template
dokan_kits_get_template('template-name', [
    'var1' => 'value1',
    'var2' => 'value2',
]);

// Get the template manager
$template_manager = dokan_kits_template_manager();
```

## Utilities

```php
// Check if Dokan is active
$is_active = dokan_kits_is_dokan_active();

// Check if Dokan Pro is active
$is_pro = dokan_kits_is_dokan_pro_active();

// Logger
dokan_kits_logger()->info('Log message', ['context' => 'value']);
```
